close_reason: "Direct callers of extension-created commands get missing_required_option, unknown_option and extension_option_disabled before the handler runs"
contract_change:
  api: "PmClient.run, runRegisteredCommandForTest and createExtensionTestHarness().runCommand for extension-created commands with declared flags; normalizeDirectExtensionCommandOptions (new optional DirectExtensionOptionPolicy argument)"
  before: A missing required flag threw exit 2 with code undefined; a key that was neither declared nor host-owned reached the handler; a disabled flag threw without a code (the CLI derived missing_required_option from the message and printed pm create examples)
  after: "missing_required_option (flag, field = handler key, recovery.missing, a command example), unknown_option (flag) and extension_option_disabled are thrown before the handler runs on every caller path; host-owned keys (reserved host flags in camel, snake or dashed form, force, subcommand, inputResponses, requestState) pass through; on a native command path an extension extends, undeclared keys still pass through; pm-calendar declares --inherit-focus"
  migrate: "Match on error codes instead of messages; declare every option a handler reads with registerFlags or inline flags (keys the handler only read from direct callers are now refused); pass { undeclaredKeys: \"pass\" } to normalizeDirectExtensionCommandOptions only for a native command path"
escape_class: production_defect
